      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ‘Cut two stone tablets like the first ones and make a wooden box to put them in. Come up to me on the mountain, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I will write on those tablets what I wrote on the tablets that you broke, and then you are to put them in the box.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“So I made a box of acacia wood and cut two stone tablets like the first ones and took them up the mountain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wrote on those tablets the same words that he had written the first time, the Ten Commandments that he gave you when he spoke from the fire on the day you were gathered at the mountain. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave me the tablets, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I turned and went down the mountain. Then, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded, I put them in the box that I had made — and they have been there ever since.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
